# Kibana overview cluster URL.
# The scanner connects here and discovers all ES clusters automatically:
#   - The local ES cluster Kibana is connected to
#   - Any CCS remote clusters returned by GET /_remote/info (connected=true)
#
# One Kibana URL per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Credentials are stored separately in api-keys.json (see auth.py).
#
# Example:
# https://overview.qa.cld.elstc.co
